review of the prospectus or us as is customarily performed in underwritten offerings. </I></B></FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">Our dealer manager, Griffin
