STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><B><I>Failure to qualify as a REIT would adversely affect our operations and our ability to make distributions as we will incur additional
