SIZE="2"><B><I>Complying with the REIT requirements may cause us to forego otherwise attractive opportunities. </I></B></FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">To
