STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">On January&nbsp;29, 2009, Renfro Properties, LLC refinanced the prior loan on the Renfro property with Inland Bank&nbsp;&amp; Trust
