one or more years of annual rent in the event of a rental loss. </FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">Tenants will be required to provide proof of insurance by
