manager with respect to a particular property, we will pay our property manager an oversight fee equal to 1% of the gross revenues of the property managed. In no event will we pay both a property management fee to the property manager and an
oversight fee to our property manager with respect to a particular property. </FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">In addition, we may pay our property manager or
