partnership by the partner, (2)&nbsp;increased by the partner&#146;s (a)&nbsp;allocable share of the operating partnership&#146;s income and (b)&nbsp;allocable share of indebtedness of the operating partnership, and (3)&nbsp;reduced, but not below
