authority or control over our assets or who provide investment advise for a fee with respect to our assets, or their affiliates). </FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><B><A NAME="rom52329_108">
</A>Consequences of Holding Plan Assets </B></FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">In the event that our underlying assets were treated by the DOL as Plan Assets,
