and conduct the business of our operating partnership. </FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">Concurrently with the contribution of the Griffin properties to our
