expenses. All of these dealer manager costs will be paid out of the dealer manager fee. </FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">In accordance with FINRA rules, in no
