</I></B></FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">The limited partners of the Operating Partnership will have the right to cause the Operating Partnership to redeem
