Partnership will conduct certain activities through our taxable REIT subsidiary, The GC Net Lease REIT TRS, Inc., a Delaware corporation (the &#147;TRS&#148;) formed on September&nbsp;2, 2008, which is a wholly owned subsidiary of the Operating
