STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">The Company does not expect to have any employees.&nbsp;The Advisor will be primarily responsible for managing the business affairs and
