STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">Affiliates of The GC Net Lease REIT, Inc. (the &#147;Company&#148;) will contribute a property (the &#147;Property&#148;) leased to Renfro
